    "q": "As a result of reaction of CO gas with water vapor in a 2-liter closed container at 900K, CO₂ and H₂ gases where formed. What is the concentration of gas mixture at equilibrium if 4mole of each of reactant and products where placed as Kp = 6.25? (1د 2025)",
    "a": "M(mol/L) = (n(mol))/(V(L)) = (4)/(2) = 2 (mol/L)\nCO(g) + H2O(g) ⇌ CO2(g) + H2(g)\n2 2 2 2\nQ = ([CO2][H2])/([CO][H2O]) = ((2)(2))/((2)(2)) = 1\n ng = ng(P) - ng(R) = 2 - 2 = 0\nKp = Kc إذا ng = 0 قيمة ان بما\n Kp = Kc = 6.25\nWe note that Kc > Q so the direction of the reaction is forward that is in the product +x and in the reactant -x\nنكتب الفرضية\n[TABLE]\nKc = ([CO2][H2])/([CO][H2O])\n6.25 = ([2+X]^2)/([2-X]^2)\n2.5 = (2+X)/(2-X) وسطين × طرفين\n2.5(2-X) = 2+X\n5 - 2.5X = 2+X\n2.5X + X = 5-2\n3.5X = 3 → X = (3)/(3.5)\nX = 0.857M\nنعوض قيمة X في الخطوة الثالثة (state equilibrium) لمعرفة التراكيز عند الاتزان\n[CO] = [H2O] = 2 - X\n[CO] = [H2O] = 2 - 0.857\n[CO] = [H2O] = 1.143M\n[CO2] = [H2] = 2 + X\n[CO2] = [H2] = 2 + 0.857\n[CO2] = [H2] = 2.857M\n I\n التعليم 29"
